## Validation Philosophy

**Every artifact gets challenged. Every finding gets fixed. No cherry-picking.**

Planning artifacts (brief, PRD, architecture, stories):
1. **Party Mode** -- exhaustive multi-agent debate, apply all improvements
2. **Advanced Elicitation** -- probe until zero ambiguity, update artifact
3. **Adversarial Review** -- 2+ passes, apply all fixes between passes,
   continue until only nitpicks remain
4. **Changelog** -- document what changed and why

Implementation artifacts (code, tests):
1. **Code Review** (opus) -- exhaustive, apply all fixes, re-review until clean
2. **QA Validation** (sonnet) -- every acceptance criterion, fix and re-validate
3. **Story Validation** -- automated gate, remediate and re-run until pass
4. **Sprint-level Review** -- adversarial + party mode on complete sprint

